flowchart TD
  accTitle: Scoring and readiness gate separation
  accDescr: Customer answers determine maturity, evidence status determines confidence, diagnostic facts and domain scores drive gates, and demo illustrations never score.
  A[Customer answer ratings] --> B[Capability maturity]
  C[Evidence status] --> D[Independent confidence]
  B --> E[Pre-gate readiness]
  F[Domain scores and diagnostic facts] --> G[Seven gate traces]
  E --> G
  G --> H[Final readiness]
  H --> I[Findings and roadmap]
  J[Demo illustrations] -. presentation only .-> I
